\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par  \cf0 1. Behold, how good it is,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And how beautiful too,
\par For brothers to unite as one,
\par And so stay together.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2. It is oil and ointment
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Unto the head applied,
\par And it continues to spread on,
\par Until it wets the beard.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. It's like that of Aaron,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And descends to the earth
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 It reaches down unto the edge,
\par Of the raiment he wears.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  It is like Hermon's dew,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0  That drips unto the earth,
\par  Upon the lands of mount Zion,
\par  And makes it watered down.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  It is upon these lands,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0  That God decreed blessings,
\par  And as well His eternal life,
\par \pard     From hence unto the end.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

